Hi Melissa,

I think that warning is fine (pretty sure comma separator is default for write.csv). Rethinking this you should probably include `row.names=FALSE` parameter as well. The below code should produce the correct file that will work with MSstatsShiny.

write.csv(df, file="input_comma_delim.csv", row.names=FALSE)

